{{define "content"}}
<header class="hero"><div class="wrap hero-c">
  <span class="tag-live rise d1"><span class="dot"></span>Compare</span>
  <h1 class="rise d2">Shulada vs the <span class="mg">popular platforms</span>.</h1>
  <p class="sub rise d3">An honest comparison with VTEX, Shopify and Tiendanube. Each is good at what it does; this is where Shulada includes out of the box what others usually charge extra for.</p>
  <div class="cta-row rise d4"><a class="btn btn-primary btn-lg" href="/en/empezar">Create my store</a><a class="btn btn-ghost btn-lg" href="/en#incluye">Everything included →</a></div>
</div></header>

<section style="padding-top:14px"><div class="wrap">
  <div class="cmp-wrap reveal"><table class="cmp">
    <thead><tr><th>Capability</th><th class="sh">Shulada</th><th>VTEX</th><th>Shopify</th><th>Tiendanube</th></tr></thead>
    <tbody>
      <tr><td>Local payment methods & installments</td><td class="col-sh"><span class="yes">{{template "ic" "spark"}}Built in</span></td><td>Depends on integration</td><td class="no">Via apps or third parties</td><td>LATAM-local</td></tr>
      <tr><td>B2B & wholesale in the same store</td><td class="col-sh"><span class="yes">{{template "ic" "spark"}}Included</span></td><td>Yes (their strength)</td><td class="no">High plan / separate B2B</td><td class="no">Limited</td></tr>
      <tr><td>AI included (search & answers)</td><td class="col-sh"><span class="yes">{{template "ic" "spark"}}Included</span></td><td class="no">Via apps / partners</td><td class="no">Via apps</td><td class="no">Limited</td></tr>
      <tr><td>Team seats</td><td class="col-sh"><span class="yes">{{template "ic" "spark"}}Unlimited</span></td><td>By contract</td><td class="no">Staff capped by plan</td><td class="no">By plan</td></tr>
      <tr><td>Sandbox + undo/versions</td><td class="col-sh"><span class="yes">{{template "ic" "spark"}}Included</span></td><td>Environments (technical)</td><td class="no">Limited</td><td class="no">Limited</td></tr>
      <tr><td>Cost of extra apps / modules</td><td class="col-sh"><span class="yes">{{template "ic" "spark"}}All included</span></td><td class="no">Implementation / partners</td><td class="no">Paid app ecosystem</td><td>Some apps</td></tr>
      <tr><td>Seller marketplace</td><td class="col-sh"><span class="yes">{{template "ic" "spark"}}Included</span></td><td>Yes (enterprise)</td><td class="no">Via apps</td><td class="no">Not native</td></tr>
      <tr><td>Time and effort to launch</td><td class="col-sh"><span class="yes">{{template "ic" "spark"}}Minutes, no dev</span></td><td class="no">Project with a partner</td><td>Fast</td><td>Fast</td></tr>
    </tbody>
  </table></div>
  <p class="mute reveal" style="font-size:12.5px;margin-top:14px;text-align:center;max-width:760px;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto">Comparison to the best of our knowledge, for informational purposes. Platforms change features, plans and prices often; always verify with each provider. Third-party marks belong to their respective owners.</p>

  <div class="sec-head reveal" style="margin-top:56px"><p class="eyebrow">Let's be fair</p>
    <h2>What each one is good at.</h2></div>
  <div class="models">
    <div class="model reveal"><span class="i">{{template "ic" "spark"}}</span><b>Shopify</b><p>Great for D2C and launching fast; its app ecosystem is huge (and many apps cost extra).</p></div>
    <div class="model reveal"><span class="i">{{template "ic" "building"}}</span><b>VTEX</b><p>Powerful for enterprise and B2B; usually needs an implementation partner and a longer project.</p></div>
    <div class="model reveal"><span class="i">{{template "ic" "cart"}}</span><b>Tiendanube</b><p>Very good to get started in LATAM; falls short when you need serious B2B or multiple channels.</p></div>
    <div class="model reveal"><span class="i">{{template "ic" "bolt"}}</span><b>Shulada</b><p>When you want it all included —B2C, B2B, marketplace, AI— fast and without paying for modules or seats.</p></div>
  </div>

  <div class="close reveal" style="margin-top:52px"><h2>More included, fewer surprises.</h2>
    <div class="cta-row" style="justify-content:center;margin-top:26px"><a class="btn btn-primary btn-lg" href="/en/empezar">Create my store</a><a class="btn btn-ghost btn-lg" href="/en/planes">See how pricing works →</a></div></div>
</div></section>
{{end}}
